(text "P5 TIA (bom 4): OPA1612 front amp, BUF634A in the loop, C_f on the buffer output. R_off 133/116 (MIDCODE 32.5) realised as 4 x 536 / 4 x 464 in parallel (TE RA73 0603 AlN 0.5 W, 0.1 % 25 ppm thin film, enlarged copper): ~11 V x 83/95 mA = 0.9/1.0 W per rail, 46/52 % per leg - bom items 13/14 ruled (heat managed by placement)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "78e172a2-0b74-4061-99b1-408c4eba1226"))
(text "R_f RG3216N 0.05 %; C_f/C_col C0G. 100n decoupling per supply pin is kicad-only (not in the deck). Footprints/MPNs: parts pass 2026-09-28." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 21.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "12223601-98ab-4cd2-be11-53b7b4c105ed"))
