(text "PER-CELL TEST: COL_P/COL_M taps on EACH channel are through 1k (reduced, not zero loading). Use low-C active probes; no 50-ohm termination. Measure cell weight from baseline/test delta at OUT_P/M pre-relay; summing taps check compliance/settling. Place each tap's GND pad beside its probe pad on PCB; keep node-side stubs short." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.000 24.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dde2384e-500a-47f3-9e32-fdcd8eaa04b8"))
